== Overview ==
The '''Octo Rocket Soldier Toilet''' is an enemy released in the [[Episode 71 Update]]. It only spawns in [[Endless Mode]], and nightmare

== Appearance ==
It is a toilet that has 2 rocket launchers with 4 rockets on each launcher. The toilet is wearing a helmet and is wearing armor.

== Waves ==
Octo Rocket Soldier Toilet spawns around wave 30.

== Trivia ==

* When Octo Rocket Soldier Toilet moves the flaps next to the rockets flap as he moves.

